  "details": "If you open the Camera tab, the options still show for Photo Camera and Stream Camera. VRChat Plus features include Icon Camera, and Gallery Camera.\n\nI expected both, the Photo Camera and the Gallery Camera to double as a Print Camera, or have buttons to switch between them.\n\n\"Gallery Camera\" still seems like confusing lingo for VRChat Plus users, because it's ambiguous on whether it's taking a Photo or Print.\n\nThese features should be merged, or better yet, be able to switch a Photo Camera with a Print Camera in the camera menu's UI.",
